    "The day30 snapshot stores the last challenge CH_R05_03 result, not the campaign boss result. Campaign R05_B receipts preserve ticks but not its full HP maps in the action log, so no campaign-boss HP delta is asserted. The fixed-snapshot matrix supplies bounded HP and elapsed-time evidence for B_R05_B.",
